      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a profound disconnect, and it's understandable that you feel lost when your connection to yourself has faded. That feeling of being a stranger in your own skin is a heavy weight to carry. Please know that these feelings, while intense, are not permanent, and there are people who can help you navigate this difficult time. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide you with the support and tools you need to start feeling like yourself again.",
